{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/hadzija7/cursor-workshop-15may/pull/2","repo":"hadzija7/cursor-workshop-15may","number":2,"set":"agent","source":"cursor","title":"Cafe planner: multiple quantities per meal and UI demo recording","body":"<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Summary\n\nPlanner rows stay **one line per dish** with a **minimum quantity of one** while the line remains. Meal cards expose **increment / decrement** (minus is disabled at one) plus **Remove**; **Live plan** mirrors the same controls. **Servings**, **shopping list starter**, and **total picks** derive from **`summarizePlan(planLines)`** and scale with quantity.\n\n## Demo\n\nAutomated recording of adding **Sunny Noodle Bowls**, raising quantity twice, adding a second pick, decrementing from the sidebar, then removing that line:\n\n<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-d4a9c99f-2fc0-4ae4-900b-b99e31782f4e/artifacts?path=%2Fopt%2Fcursor%2Fartifacts%2Fcafe-planner-multi-qty-demo.webm\"><img src=\"https://cursor.com/artifacts/c/art-f5ce6ed4-3a04-494f-8d4f-573f4ec19d19\" alt=\"cafe-planner-multi-qty-demo.webm\" /></a>\n\n**Reproduce locally**\n\n```bash\npnpm install\npnpm demo:video   # CI=1 playwright test · builds Next, serves :3000, writes webm under test-results/\n```\n\nVitest keeps running **only `src/**/*.test.{ts,tsx}`** so Playwright specs under **`e2e/`** stay out of `pnpm test`.\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-d4a9c99f-2fc0-4ae4-900b-b99e31782f4e\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img alt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-d4a9c99f-2fc0-4ae4-900b-b99e31782f4e\"><picture><source media=\